{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1115.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"15790d89657468029d8406774e0b6d3047b02c736acd3ad5b85eb620ce163fe3","ja":"ま、毎日外食というのはちょっと、\nお金が……いえ、栄養バランスが気になりますわ！","zh":"天、天天在外面吃的话稍微有点……\n开销太……不对，是营养搭配真叫人担心呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
