{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1115.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"eb772215970a2c015e2fa6128fcdcc984c51b02da8373eb9933e379b7921795f","ja":"例えば……Todoリストを活用するとか。\n小さな達成感が、何度も得られるんだよ。","zh":"比如……善用待办清单之类的。\n这样就能反复获得小小的成就感哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1115.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ae0a99d9cdf98204bb7dae0aa50a7cf85e33b94151fbd1cdf211247bfdeb4d35","ja":"それは、翼には向いていないように思いますわね。\nでは、我が家のコロッケを毎日差し入れて……。","zh":"那似乎不太适合翼呢。\n那么，就每天送我们家的可乐饼过去……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1115.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1bfc7bc3bc8b60fd89d0af7a4e637463d4daa6d9b9c33f4d1bbcaa960a19505a","ja":"いえ、それではお母さ……我が家のシェフに\n負担をかけてしまう事になりますわね……。","zh":"不，那样的话就会给妈妈……给我家的大厨\n增添负担了呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1115.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"16c4611064f0733ef70a20a64cf13097b578774f34b5ab2849ec112e71b5ebdb","ja":"じゃあ、空手の帯を締めて練習するのはどう？\n身も心もグッと引き締まって、自然とやる気が……。","zh":"那系上空手道腰带练习怎么样？\n身心都能彻底紧绷起来，自然而然就会涌起干劲……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
